---
// DesignSystem.astro
---
<section id="design-section" class="scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="border-b border-borderSubtle pb-4 mb-6">
    <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-textSecondary uppercase tracking-widest">Estética & Ergonomia Visual</span>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-textPrimary mt-1">Design System Noturno & Tabela WCAG 2.1</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-textSecondary">
      Paleta noturna em tom Argila Escura (<code>#37211B</code>), Off-White (<code>#FFFCE4</code>) e Carvão Intenso (<code>#1A1A1A</code>), calibrada contra reflexos luminosos e aprovada em testes de acessibilidade.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
    <!-- Tokens Display Grid -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl border border-borderSubtle space-y-4">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-textPrimary text-base mb-2">Tokens Cromáticos da Aplicação</h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-textPrimary">Fundo Canvas</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#37211B</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-surface border border-borderSubtle mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-textPrimary">Superfície Card</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#1A1A1A</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-textPrimary mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-canvas">Off-White</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#FFFCE4</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-accent mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-accent">Terracota Luz</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#E68770</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-textSecondary mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-textSecondary">Off-White Suave</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#D8CFC0</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-success mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-success">Verde Menta</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#34D399</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-accent/30 text-xs text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
        <strong class="text-accent">Conforto Óptico em Modo Escuro:</strong> O tom de argila escura dessaturada elimina o cansaço visual comum do preto puro, oferecendo uma leitura suave do texto em Off-White com excelente separação de componentes.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- WCAG Contrast Matrix Table -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl border border-borderSubtle">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-textPrimary text-base mb-2">Validação Luminotécnica (WCAG 2.1)</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-textSecondary mb-4">Medições de contraste contra o plano de fundo Argila Escura (#37211B).</p>

      <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <span class="text-textPrimary font-sans">Off-White (#FFFCE4)</span>
          <span class="text-success font-bold">14.5:1 (AAA)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <span class="text-textSecondary font-sans">Off-White Suave (#D8CFC0)</span>
          <span class="text-success font-bold">9.8:1 (AAA)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <span class="text-accent font-sans">Terracota Luz (#E68770)</span>
          <span class="text-success font-bold">5.8:1 (AA)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <span class="text-success font-sans">Verde Menta (#34D399)</span>
          <span class="text-success font-bold">7.8:1 (AAA)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <span class="text-danger font-sans">Vermelho Alerta (#FCA5A5)</span>
          <span class="text-success font-bold">7.9:1 (AAA)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
